# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:11
translate turkish jamie0_86844818:

    # "I decide to go see Jamie. I walk up to her door and knock twice."
    "Jamie'yi görmeye karar veriyorum. Kapısına yaklaşıp iki kez kapıyı çalıyorum."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:15
translate turkish jamie0_6d10994a:

    # "After a minute or so, she answers, wearing cloth shorts and a t-shirt tight enough that I can make out the outlines of her nipples through it."
    "Bir dakika kadar sonra kapıyı açıyor; üzerinde kumaş şort ve o kadar dar bir tişört var ki, tişörtün içinden meme uçlarının hatlarını seçebiliyorum."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:17
translate turkish jamie0_d41d8cd9:

    # voice "voices/jamie_004.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_004.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:18
translate turkish jamie0_ae29242d:

    # gnd "Oh hi, [pcname]. What's up?"
    gnd "Merhaba [pcname]. N'aber?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:21
translate turkish jamie0_1142edfa:

    # pc "I was just wondering what you were up to."
    pc "Ne yaptığını merak ediyordum da."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:23
translate turkish jamie0_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice "voices/jamie_005.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_005.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:24
translate turkish jamie0_5c68d96a:

    # gnd "I'm just watching TV. Want to come inside and hang out?"
    gnd "Sadece televizyon izliyorum. İçeri gelip biraz takılmak ister misin?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:27
translate turkish jamie0_61f77a4c:

    # pc "Sure."
    pc "Tabii."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:30
translate turkish jamie0_8530d6f7:

    # pc "Not right now."
    pc "Şu anda olmaz."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:35
translate turkish jamie0_d41d8cd9_2:

    # voice "voices/jamie_009b.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_009b.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:36
translate turkish jamie0_7761ed77:

    # gnd "I'm sorry, I'm not really feeling up to going anywhere tonight."
    gnd "Üzgünüm, bu gece bir yere gitmeye pek havamda değilim."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:37
translate turkish jamie0_e3b9539d:

    # gnd "I'm in the middle of a TV show and already dressed for bed."
    gnd "Bir dizi izliyorum ve çoktan pijamalarımı giydim."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:39
translate turkish jamie0_9c09b9dd:

    # gnd "Do you want to come inside and chat a bit though?"
    gnd "Yine de içeri gelip biraz sohbet etmek ister misin?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:47
translate turkish jamie0_4f724fa8:

    # gnd "What?"
    gnd "Ne?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:48
translate turkish jamie0_209b1712:

    # pc "See ya."
    pc "Görüşürüz."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:49
translate turkish jamie0_2c2201d1:

    # gnd "Uh okay, see you later then."
    gnd "Peki, o zaman sonra görüşürüz."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:51
translate turkish jamie0_74706d57:

    # "She looks disappointed as she shuts the door and I walk back over to my house."
    "Kapıyı kapatırken hayal kırıklığına uğramış gibi görünüyor ve ben de evime doğru yürüyorum."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:56
translate turkish leavejamie_fc2cf32e:

    # gnd "Okay, maybe we can do something some other time?"
    gnd "Tamam, belki başka bir zaman bir şeyler yapabiliriz?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:57
translate turkish leavejamie_61f77a4c:

    # pc "Sure."
    pc "Tabii."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:58
translate turkish leavejamie_60ba3b2f:

    # gnd "Well, I'll see you later then."
    gnd "Peki, o zaman sonra görüşürüz."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:59
translate turkish leavejamie_209b1712:

    # pc "See ya."
    pc "Görüşürüz."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:60
translate turkish leavejamie_74706d57:

    # "She looks disappointed as she shuts the door and I walk back over to my house."
    "Kapıyı kapatırken hayal kırıklığına uğramış gibi görünüyor ve ben de evime doğru yürüyorum."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:68
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_b827e096:

    # "She leads me to the living room, where the TV is paused on a show that I don't recognize."
    "Beni oturma odasına götürüyor; televizyonda tanımadığım bir dizi duraklatılmış durumda."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:69
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_1410557b:

    # gnd "I was just trying to finish up this series that I've been watching before school starts up again."
    gnd "Okul yeniden başlamadan önce izlediğim bu diziyi bitirmeye çalışıyordum."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:70
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_442eef5c:

    # pc "Cool. I barely watch any TV anymore."
    pc "Harika. Artık neredeyse hiç televizyon izlemiyorum."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:71
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_e0203869:

    # gnd "Really? I love TV. I probably watch too much."
    gnd "Gerçekten mi? Televizyonu seviyorum. Muhtemelen çok fazla izliyorum."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:73
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_5407ea16:

    # "We sit there for a few moments in an awkward silence. There are a couple times when Jamie seems like she wants to say something, but doesn't."
    "Birkaç dakika boyunca garip bir sessizlik içinde oturuyoruz. Jamie birkaç kez bir şey söylemek istiyor gibi görünüyor ama söylemiyor."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:74
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_58b01cd5:

    # "It feels very strange, like she is uncomfortable with me for some reason. Like there is something between us."
    "Çok tuhaf bir his, sanki bir nedenden dolayı benim yanımda rahatsız gibi. Sanki aramızda bir şey varmış gibi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:75
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_396a0d53:

    # "I have to break this silence with literally any conversation."
    "Bu sessizliği, ne olursa olsun bir konuşma başlatarak bozmam gerekiyor."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:76
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_1171aaad:

    # pc "Oh, I have a cell phone now."
    pc "Ah, artık bir cep telefonum var."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:78
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_5c1dfc7a:

    # gnd "Awesome, what's your number?"
    gnd "Harika, numaran ne?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:79
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_53b692f6:

    # "I tell her my new phone number and she puts it into her phone."
    "Ona yeni telefon numaramı söylüyorum ve o da numaramı telefonuna kaydediyor."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:81
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_b9feb81a:

    # "Then she turns her phone around and holds it up to take a picture of herself."
    "Sonra telefonunu ters çevirip kendine bir fotoğraf çekmek için havaya kaldırıyor."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:83
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_5ad0b0e8:

    # gnd "I sent you a text message, along with a picture of me so you can add me into your contacts, and we can chat whenever."
    gnd "Sana bir kısa mesaj gönderdim, içindeki fotoğrafımla birlikte; böylece beni rehberine ekleyebilirsin ve istediğimiz zaman sohbet edebiliriz."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:88
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_ea0a9e4e:

    # pc "I got it. I'll just add you to my contacts real quick."
    pc "Anladım. Seni hemen rehberime ekleyeceğim."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:89
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_d7eecc80:

    # pc "And done."
    pc "Bitti."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:90
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_7a48c010:

    # gnd "Awesome."
    gnd "Harika."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:93
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_a06bb2fa:

    # pc "Great. I'll be sure to add you as soon as I get back home and get the phone set up."
    pc "Harika. Eve dönüp telefonumu kurar kurmaz seni ekleyeceğim."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:95
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_570f0e90:

    # "She sits on the couch next to me, leaning back against the arm rest to face me, her bare legs folded underneath her."
    "Yanımdaki kanepeye oturdu, kol dayama yerine yaslanarak bana dönmüş, çıplak bacaklarını altına katlamıştı."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:96
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_06525d7f:

    # gnd "Do you want to watch my TV show with me?"
    gnd "Benimle birlikte dizimi izlemek ister misin?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:97
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_61f77a4c:

    # pc "Sure."
    pc "Tabii."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:98
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_49f2ae65:

    # gnd "It's called The Nieces of Callahan. Have you ever watched any of it?"
    gnd "Adı \"The Nieces of Callahan\". Hiç izledin mi?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:99
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_c7fa5d68:

    # pc "Nope."
    pc "Hayır."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:100
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_f8a2b09a:

    # gnd "Well I'm sure you'll be completely lost, but I'll try to catch you up."
    gnd "Eminim hiçbir şey anlamayacaksın, ama sana özetlemeye çalışacağım."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:102
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_fb6f3632:

    # "She plays the show, but talks pretty much the whole time through it, explaining which character was which, who was sleeping with who, and which characters she liked and hated."
    "Diziyi oynatıyor, ama neredeyse başından sonuna kadar konuşup duruyor; hangi karakterin kim olduğunu, kimin kiminle yattığını, hangi karakterleri sevip hangilerinden nefret ettiğini açıklıyor."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:103
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_8a51ccf8:

    # "The show doesn't interest me too much, but as we sit together, she moves closer and closer, until our sides are touching."
    "Dizi beni pek ilgilendirmiyor, ama birlikte otururken bana gittikçe yaklaşıyor, ta ki yanlarımız birbirine değene kadar."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:104
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_df180490:

    # "I think about putting an arm around her shoulder, but I'm not sure what she would think about it."
    "Kolumu omzuna atmayı düşünüyorum, ama bunun hakkında ne düşüneceğini bilmiyorum."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:105
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_02a91ff8:

    # "Still, being there next to her is nice."
    "Yine de, yanında olmak güzel."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:106
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_7c085331:

    # "Finally, the show ends."
    "Sonunda dizi bitti."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:108
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_616bf526:

    # gnd "Did you like it?"
    gnd "Beğendin mi?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:109
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_28b82c1c:

    # pc "Honestly, I couldn't really follow it, but what I saw was okay."
    pc "Dürüst olmak gerekirse, pek takip edemedim, ama gördüğüm kadarıyla fena değildi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:110
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_82d9fc6f:

    # gnd "Yeah, you kind of have to watch it from the beginning."
    gnd "Evet, bunu baştan izlemek gerekiyor."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:111
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_95fb6df8:

    # gnd "Thanks for sitting through it with me anyways. That was nice."
    gnd "Yine de benimle birlikte izlediğin için teşekkürler. Hoştu."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:112
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_4eb9bd3a:

    # pc "Yeah it was. I enjoyed it."
    pc "Evet, öyleydi. Keyif aldım."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:115
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_0bde0b2d:

    # gnd "I'm so glad you're back in town. I know we didn't hang out much before you left, but I've always liked you and thought about you."
    gnd "Şehre geri döndüğüne çok sevindim. Sen gitmeden önce pek takılmadığımızı biliyorum, ama seni hep sevdim ve seni düşündüm."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:116
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_48b6a79b:

    # pc "Yeah, we had some good times when we were younger."
    pc "Evet, gençken güzel zamanlar geçirdik."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:117
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_234edbbb:

    # gnd "Yeah we did. I wish we would have stayed friends through high school. I made a lot of bad decisions then."
    gnd "Evet, geçirdik. Keşke lise boyunca arkadaş kalabilseydik. O zamanlar çok kötü kararlar verdim."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:118
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_ce0b88b7:

    # pc "I think we all did."
    pc "Sanırım hepimiz verdik."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:119
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_ec3ba06e:

    # gnd "Ain't that the truth."
    gnd "Ne kadar doğru."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:121
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_68579f4f:

    # "She smiles at me, and we stand awkwardly for a few moments."
    "Bana gülümsüyor ve bir süre garip bir şekilde öylece duruyoruz."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:122
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_5a0cac5d:

    # pc "Anyways, I better get home."
    pc "Neyse, artık eve gitsem iyi olacak."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:124
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_792d2ec7:

    # gnd "Okay, well thanks for coming to see me. Stop by anytime or send me a text if you want to chat."
    gnd "Tamam, beni görmeye geldiğin için teşekkürler. Ne zaman istersen uğra ya da sohbet etmek istersen bana mesaj at."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:126
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_d41d8cd9:

    # voice "voices/jamie_007.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_007.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:127
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_598f8960:

    # gnd "See you later."
    gnd "Görüşürüz."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie0.rpy:129
translate turkish tvchatwithjamie_3608be46:

    # "She smiles and waves as I walk out the door, shutting it behind me, and walk over to my house."
    "Ben kapıdan çıkıp arkamdan kapıyı kapatırken o gülümsüyor ve el sallıyor, ben de evime doğru yürüyorum."

